NON-OBVIOUS EDGE / SEESAW CONSEQUENCE

As capability catalogs become dynamically discoverable and tools
become mutable runtime objects, the stable security primitive cannot
be the tool name. Authority has to bind to a versioned capability
claim: principal + purpose + exact capability/schema/provider + data
scope + budget + temporal fingerprint + expected effect. Dynamic
discovery increases capability abundance; the scarce object becomes a
continuously valid grant.
